          "short": "Gradient row, in order: $\\frac12,\\ 1,\\ 2,\\ 3$.",
          "worked": "Draw each tangent and estimate its rise divided by its run. At function values $\\frac12,1,2,3$, the respective gradients are $\\frac12,1,2,3$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
