        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=y$, or $f(x)=f'(x)$.",
          "worked": "The gradient equals the function value at the point of tangency. For $y=e^x$, $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=e^x=y$.",
